abmod (1.0.13) bullseye; urgency=low

  * Fix the APRS parking coming back onto the parked frequency instead of the
    saved default: the saved centre frequency is now read from settings.json,
    because retuning writes the live configuration.
  * Arm the APRS idle clock at start-up as well, not only when a listener
    leaves. A receiver that had just been restarted and that nobody had
    visited since never parked, which is the one case the rule exists for.

 -- IU2QDA <iu2qda@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:30:00 +0000

abmod (1.0.12) bullseye; urgency=low

  * Add the option to park the receiver on the APRS frequency while nobody is
    listening, and return to the saved centre frequency as soon as someone
    connects. Off by default.
  * Fix DMR producing nothing at all when a digital mode was switched on: the
    metadata chain now outputs FLOAT, so the secondary demodulator can still
    be wired to the audio buffer.
  * Put the remaining Italian comments and local names in the source into
    English.

 -- IU2QDA <iu2qda@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:30:00 +0000

abmod (1.0.11) bullseye; urgency=low

  * Add a DMR mode that works without the AMBE codec: the chain stops at
    digiham's decoder, so radio IDs, talkgroups and timeslots are still
    reported, with no audio. Upstream's full chain is still used whenever a
    codec is present.
  * Document the CTCSS readout and the automatic direct sampling in the
    feature list, where they were missing.

 -- IU2QDA <iu2qda@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0000

abmod (1.0.10) bullseye; urgency=low

  * Send the direct sampling state from handleSdrAvailable, so the DS badge
    survives a page reload.

